[AS7's Example 19.6 (Thevenin at the output port)]

e,1,0,60
r,1,2,40
h,2,3

analysis: dc
tool: th
n1: 3
n2: 0
note: The equivalent tools take no Expert Mode equations, so the answers come back as formulas in the h parameters and the numbers go in afterwards. Naming the four as unknowns is what makes their equations bite.
rounding: 4
si: no
units: yes
solve_equations: x = vth
solve_equations: y = req
solve_equations: h11 = 1000
solve_equations: h12 = -2
solve_equations: h21 = 10
solve_equations: h22 = 2e-4
solve_unknowns: x, y, h11, h12, h21, h22


